            "action": "upgrade-runtime-php",
            "description": "El host Linux publica PHP `7.4.3-4ubuntu2.29`, pero el repo exige `^8.4`. Homologar un runtime PHP moderno antes de volver a intentar PECL `dbus` y el ownership real.",
            "commands": [
